WEBVTT

01:38.150 --> 01:41.070
[The Demon Hunter's Romance]

01:41.130 --> 01:44.020
[Episode 7]

01:52.400 --> 01:53.400
Good, you're here.

01:54.680 --> 01:56.050
Where did you take my dad?

01:57.840 --> 01:58.950
You've got some nerve.

01:59.610 --> 02:00.730
I'm not afraid of you at all!

02:01.430 --> 02:02.310
Is that so?

02:11.380 --> 02:12.190
It's a trap again!

02:12.910 --> 02:13.630
Impressive.

02:13.960 --> 02:14.750
Take Tingzhou out.

02:53.070 --> 02:53.730
No worries.

02:53.870 --> 02:54.750
We're fully prepared.

02:55.210 --> 02:56.520
There's no way he's getting away this time.

02:56.790 --> 02:57.390
He's really here?

02:59.040 --> 03:00.280
Let me see

03:00.400 --> 03:01.400
who he is!

03:06.560 --> 03:07.230
I'm here to help you!

03:34.280 --> 03:35.690
[Heal and Help]

03:50.030 --> 03:50.710
There's no big deal.

03:51.120 --> 03:52.030
Take some medicine, and you'll be fine.

03:52.560 --> 03:53.660
I'll prescribe it for you.

03:54.680 --> 03:55.670
Thank you, Physician Jiu.

03:59.560 --> 04:00.390
My Lady.

04:01.360 --> 04:02.670
Actually, I heard you call me

04:02.690 --> 04:03.570
last night.

04:04.630 --> 04:05.960
But I don't know why.

04:06.560 --> 04:07.210
I could hear,

04:07.240 --> 04:08.480
but I just couldn't open my eyes

04:08.800 --> 04:09.680
or move a bit.

04:12.000 --> 04:13.310
You were bewitched by a demonic spell.

04:18.180 --> 04:19.640
I seriously injured that demon.

04:19.920 --> 04:21.519
It'll take him a while to recover.

04:22.390 --> 04:23.480
Just in case,

04:24.000 --> 04:26.430
the government should warn everyone in the city

04:26.840 --> 04:28.280
not to play the game

04:28.300 --> 04:29.540
of pear-genie summoning anymore.

04:31.040 --> 04:31.430
Well...

04:31.920 --> 04:33.790
If we issue such a notice as you said,

04:34.240 --> 04:35.480
what are the people going to think

04:35.520 --> 04:36.620
of our government office?

04:36.830 --> 04:37.800
Then just buy

04:37.820 --> 04:38.900
all the pears.

04:39.800 --> 04:40.190
Well...

04:41.900 --> 04:42.630
Wait, Xuanye...

04:44.390 --> 04:44.870
Banxia,

04:45.560 --> 04:46.190
come with me.

04:57.150 --> 04:58.150
What are you doing?

05:06.750 --> 05:07.560
What's wrong with you?

05:08.720 --> 05:09.310
I'm fine.

05:10.870 --> 05:12.380
You look like you're going to faint.

05:14.800 --> 05:15.860
What are you going to do?

05:19.600 --> 05:20.160
Xuanye...

05:25.480 --> 05:26.120
Banxia,

05:26.630 --> 05:27.270
come here.

05:28.480 --> 05:29.000
Hey, you...

05:29.480 --> 05:30.520
What's wrong with you?

05:33.480 --> 05:34.120
Xuan...

05:36.870 --> 05:37.600
What's this?

05:38.040 --> 05:39.300
That Mirror Demon is still alive.

05:39.750 --> 05:41.070
He might come again.

05:42.720 --> 05:43.390
If you run into danger,

05:43.640 --> 05:44.520
you must wake me up.

05:45.360 --> 05:46.360
If you can't wake me,

05:47.000 --> 05:47.909
just stab me with this.

05:48.750 --> 05:50.190
Why should I stab you?

05:51.830 --> 05:52.210
Did you

05:52.240 --> 05:53.360
catch what I just said?

05:54.800 --> 05:55.600
Yes.

05:56.500 --> 05:57.630
But what's happening?

05:58.310 --> 05:59.190
I'm feeling too drowsy.

05:59.880 --> 06:00.940
I want to sleep.

06:09.280 --> 06:10.160
What did the two of them go to do?

06:12.170 --> 06:12.990
To sleep.

06:13.920 --> 06:14.800
Sleep?

06:16.400 --> 06:16.890
I don't think

06:17.430 --> 06:18.860
this is appropriate.

06:19.750 --> 06:21.360
Xuanye used the Mountain-shaking Sword.

06:21.600 --> 06:22.150
Wait,

06:22.620 --> 06:23.300
what does the Mountain-shaking Sword

06:23.330 --> 06:24.620
have to do with sleeping?

06:25.090 --> 06:25.940
Every sword he uses

06:25.960 --> 06:27.330
takes a different toll on him.

06:27.510 --> 06:28.640
Dubhe makes him gluttonous;

06:28.670 --> 06:29.510
Mountain-shaking makes him sleepy.

06:31.720 --> 06:32.370
But he still can't

06:32.390 --> 06:34.159
drag My Lady into it.

06:37.190 --> 06:38.630
This demon is hard to deal with.

06:38.920 --> 06:39.800
Except Xuanye,

06:39.900 --> 06:40.780
who else can protect

06:40.800 --> 06:41.550
your lady?

06:45.640 --> 06:46.080
Youhuang,

06:46.430 --> 06:47.090
where are you going?

06:47.680 --> 06:48.409
Youhuang!

06:48.550 --> 06:49.430
I'm talking to you!

06:50.430 --> 06:51.480
You ignore me every time I call you!

06:51.800 --> 06:52.460
Youhuang!

06:52.920 --> 06:53.690
Wait for me!

06:58.730 --> 06:59.360
Um,

07:00.190 --> 07:01.310
what should we do now?

07:02.040 --> 07:03.000
What do you mean?

07:04.990 --> 07:06.160
There's a demon around.

07:06.750 --> 07:08.120
I'm too scared to go back home alone.

07:10.780 --> 07:11.620
You can go find an inn.

07:28.320 --> 07:29.070
Xuanye.

07:31.410 --> 07:32.100
Xuanye.

07:34.110 --> 07:35.520
I'm so thirsty.

07:35.750 --> 07:37.270
I want to have some water.

07:55.310 --> 07:56.680
A cultivator? Seriously?

07:57.510 --> 07:59.180
Don't you even know men and women should keep a proper distance?

08:00.950 --> 08:02.360
I'm engaged, okay?

08:02.950 --> 08:04.240
If they call off the engagement,

08:04.270 --> 08:05.120
will you marry me instead?

08:46.830 --> 08:47.470
Oh...

08:48.950 --> 08:50.900
Jeez, seriously?

08:54.650 --> 08:55.130
Well,

08:55.600 --> 08:56.150
um...

08:57.580 --> 08:58.470
And down here...

09:42.040 --> 09:42.590
Sir,

09:43.020 --> 09:44.540
what are you doing?

09:44.700 --> 09:45.980
We didn't do anything illegal.

09:46.140 --> 09:47.430
Why are you confiscating our pears?

09:48.250 --> 09:49.910
Consider it as the government buying them from you.

09:50.540 --> 09:51.540
You can go ask the government for money.

09:52.430 --> 09:52.950
Well...

09:53.630 --> 09:54.120
Sir,

09:54.480 --> 09:55.120
I also have

09:55.120 --> 09:56.240
some pears to sell at home.

09:56.360 --> 09:57.480
Does the government need more?

09:58.120 --> 09:59.240
Why didn't you tell me earlier?

10:00.210 --> 10:01.130
Send them all to the government office

10:01.150 --> 10:01.910
with none left!

10:02.140 --> 10:03.570
Yes, sir. I'll fetch them right away.

10:25.480 --> 10:26.130
Are you alright?

10:28.960 --> 10:30.430
That demon hunter's power is overwhelming.

10:31.020 --> 10:32.070
I'm no match for him.

10:36.990 --> 10:38.180
We can't stay here any longer.

10:39.510 --> 10:40.480
Go pack up.

10:40.880 --> 10:41.750
We'll leave the city tonight.

10:45.780 --> 10:47.020
You're so badly injured.

10:47.430 --> 10:48.360
Where can we be

10:48.470 --> 10:49.300
if not here?

10:54.350 --> 10:55.440
You stay here for rehabilitation.

10:55.630 --> 10:56.430
Let's make long-term plans

10:56.590 --> 10:57.950
after you recover, okay?

11:02.240 --> 11:03.360
How are things going out there?

11:05.400 --> 11:06.240
Everything's fine.

11:09.950 --> 11:10.560
What's wrong?

11:12.550 --> 11:13.150
Nothing.

11:26.210 --> 11:27.640
I thought you wouldn't come tonight.

11:28.450 --> 11:29.810
I was held up by the dance troupe.

11:30.420 --> 11:31.180
Sorry to have kept you waiting.

11:32.200 --> 11:33.150
I'm willing to wait for my wife

11:33.740 --> 11:34.910
no matter how long it takes.

11:39.400 --> 11:40.370
Despite a few

11:40.560 --> 11:41.770
twists and turns about our marriage,

11:42.420 --> 11:43.000
my father

11:43.030 --> 11:43.980
finally gave his consent to it.

11:44.520 --> 11:45.230
He also said

11:45.420 --> 11:46.590
he would give us a shop as a gift.

11:48.600 --> 11:49.910
But the condition is that

11:50.470 --> 11:51.950
we can neither invite our friends

11:52.420 --> 11:54.180
nor hold a grand wedding at home.

11:55.800 --> 11:56.800
I understand his concerns.

11:57.830 --> 11:58.920
And I'm actually

11:59.320 --> 12:00.470
quite tempted by that shop.

12:01.400 --> 12:02.680
But after careful consideration,

12:02.980 --> 12:03.840
I still said no.

12:08.080 --> 12:09.110
Because I promised you

12:10.520 --> 12:12.440
I will give you a proper and official wedding ceremony.

12:13.200 --> 12:14.110
I also want everyone in the city

12:14.110 --> 12:15.130
to know that

12:16.680 --> 12:17.990
you will marry me,

12:19.340 --> 12:20.860
and that you're the most beautiful woman in the world.

12:21.860 --> 12:23.070
I don't want a grand wedding ceremony.

12:23.600 --> 12:24.890
Let's leave this place together.

12:27.720 --> 12:28.490
Let's go to a place

12:29.350 --> 12:30.940
where no one knows us.

12:35.230 --> 12:36.440
I have some savings.

12:37.230 --> 12:38.560
I can keep you company when you study

12:39.200 --> 12:40.040
and cook for you.

12:41.100 --> 12:42.530
As long as I can be with you,

12:43.350 --> 12:44.160
even if

12:44.160 --> 12:45.160
it's just one year,

12:46.370 --> 12:47.610
I'll have no regrets in my life.

12:50.610 --> 12:51.300
You don't want to?

12:53.280 --> 12:53.920
I do.

12:55.540 --> 12:56.470
Having you is the best thing

12:57.520 --> 12:58.350
I could ask for.

13:56.080 --> 13:56.870
Who are you?

14:07.820 --> 14:08.680
What do you want?

14:12.230 --> 14:13.440
Don't you really want to

14:13.470 --> 14:14.520
be with her?

14:17.680 --> 14:19.690
Then I'll let you stay with her forever!

14:35.900 --> 14:36.520
Li.

14:52.290 --> 14:52.980
What are you busy with?

14:54.380 --> 14:55.080
Nothing.

14:55.870 --> 14:56.520
The mirror's face-down.

14:56.520 --> 14:57.400
Why did you still come?

14:58.030 --> 14:58.830
Didn't we agree that

14:58.970 --> 15:00.090
when the mirror is flipped over,

15:00.160 --> 15:01.560
that means I'm not available?

15:02.990 --> 15:03.870
Is it necessary

15:04.560 --> 15:06.040
between you and me?

15:07.160 --> 15:08.200
Or

15:09.040 --> 15:10.110
is there a secret

15:10.110 --> 15:11.230
you don't want me to know?

15:16.440 --> 15:17.350
Nope.

15:17.690 --> 15:19.380
Just some women's issues.

15:19.830 --> 15:20.710
What brings you here?

15:22.470 --> 15:23.580
I'm here to send you a pear.

15:28.400 --> 15:29.040
I've washed it.

15:29.680 --> 15:30.200
Take it.

15:32.970 --> 15:33.870
Didn't you promise me

15:34.160 --> 15:34.950
you wouldn't kill people

15:34.950 --> 15:35.990
for pears again before the right time?

15:36.700 --> 15:37.700
That being said,

15:38.500 --> 15:39.690
he made a wish.

15:40.430 --> 15:41.740
I had to grant it.

15:44.830 --> 15:45.560
I don't want to eat.

15:46.160 --> 15:46.710
Li,

15:47.560 --> 15:48.130
be good.

15:49.400 --> 15:50.830
Don't infuriate me.

16:00.300 --> 16:01.030
Good girl.

16:11.520 --> 16:12.990
Why doesn't this pear have a fishy smell?

16:14.830 --> 16:15.760
I almost forgot.

16:17.320 --> 16:19.630
I couldn't help but kill him

16:20.050 --> 16:21.530
as soon as he ate it.

16:24.280 --> 16:26.250
I was supposed to wait seven days,

16:28.230 --> 16:30.160
but I really couldn't help it.

16:31.830 --> 16:33.200
When I saw his face,

16:34.420 --> 16:35.650
I couldn't wait

16:36.190 --> 16:37.820
to wipe him out immediately.

16:38.950 --> 16:41.200
You mortals always say,

16:41.520 --> 16:42.990
"What you eat makes who you are." Right?

16:44.530 --> 16:45.720
The owner of this pear

16:45.980 --> 16:46.890
is a scholar.

16:48.800 --> 16:49.560
I guess

16:50.480 --> 16:51.520
this pear

16:52.030 --> 16:53.600
boasts some scholarly properties.

16:59.470 --> 17:00.350
Eat it,

17:01.520 --> 17:02.950
and you'll understand

17:03.520 --> 17:04.630
the meaning of "loyalty"

17:05.079 --> 17:06.319
and "fidelity."

17:31.800 --> 17:32.350
Banxia.

17:42.260 --> 17:43.080
You're awake.

17:47.590 --> 17:48.520
Tingzhou and Chi Xue

17:48.540 --> 17:49.460
went to buy groceries for me.

17:51.020 --> 17:51.700
You must be hungry.

17:51.800 --> 17:52.590
I've made some porridge.

18:09.520 --> 18:10.390
Why did you leave?

18:11.240 --> 18:11.930
Didn't I tell you

18:11.960 --> 18:13.150
to stick around me?

18:15.010 --> 18:16.670
But I didn't leave the Ganshan Clinic,

18:16.730 --> 18:17.760
nor did I go out.

18:18.900 --> 18:20.700
You slept for three whole days.

18:20.920 --> 18:22.550
We've been tied together the whole time.

18:22.960 --> 18:24.910
I needed to eat, drink,

18:24.930 --> 18:26.430
wash up, and use the bathroom, right?

18:31.870 --> 18:33.100
My bad. I forgot that.

18:34.960 --> 18:36.620
I know you were worried about my safety.

18:37.330 --> 18:38.810
But to protect me,

18:38.910 --> 18:40.560
there's actually a simpler method.

18:43.980 --> 18:44.910
What is it?

18:48.790 --> 18:50.150
Draw another mark on me.

18:56.470 --> 18:58.600
That monster hasn't been caught yet.

18:58.620 --> 18:59.430
I'm afraid...

19:36.810 --> 19:37.290
Done.

19:42.910 --> 19:43.480
Xuanye.

19:45.340 --> 19:47.400
I saw a scar on your chest.

19:49.090 --> 19:50.660
When did you get that?

19:53.390 --> 19:55.040
I saw it by accident.

19:55.910 --> 19:57.140
It's a big scar.

19:57.520 --> 19:58.760
Quite scary.

19:59.910 --> 20:01.080
So when did you

20:01.080 --> 20:01.590
get hurt?

20:02.320 --> 20:02.910
I don't remember.

20:04.960 --> 20:05.760
You don't remember?

20:06.190 --> 20:07.480
That was a deep wound

20:07.600 --> 20:09.080
so close to your heart.

20:09.160 --> 20:10.520
You almost died.

20:10.760 --> 20:11.670
How could you not remember?

20:12.870 --> 20:13.870
I don't remember anything

20:14.390 --> 20:15.390
from my childhood.

20:35.760 --> 20:36.480
What are you looking at?

20:40.280 --> 20:42.000
Do you want some more?

20:47.240 --> 20:47.800
Xuanye,

20:48.520 --> 20:49.520
can I

20:49.540 --> 20:50.640
go get changed later?

20:51.800 --> 20:54.110
It's been three days.

20:54.430 --> 20:55.240
It's going to stink.

21:01.560 --> 21:02.390
After I finish it

21:02.630 --> 21:03.390
I'll escort you back.

21:09.760 --> 21:10.190
Okay.

21:49.480 --> 21:49.910
Chief.

21:50.240 --> 21:50.630
Chief!

21:51.080 --> 21:51.870
A weird case again!

21:52.390 --> 21:52.960
What happened?

21:53.740 --> 21:54.700
Another murder occurred.

21:55.840 --> 21:56.670
The victim, Zhou Jingyuan,

21:56.830 --> 21:57.530
24 years old,

21:57.660 --> 21:58.550
a local in Guangping,

21:59.120 --> 21:59.840
was found dead

21:59.870 --> 22:00.390
this morning.

22:01.030 --> 22:02.400
His case is quite similar to Tian Rui's.

22:03.080 --> 22:04.910
But he didn't turn into a dried corpse

22:05.150 --> 22:06.000
Didn't turn into a dried corpse?

22:06.320 --> 22:07.190
He just aged a bit.

22:08.820 --> 22:10.270
Didn't turn into a dried corpse?

22:25.520 --> 22:26.560
Are you Chief Constable Chu?

22:26.910 --> 22:27.430
Yes, it's me.

22:27.640 --> 22:28.350
Get up and talk.

22:31.660 --> 22:33.170
Are you the one who reported the case?

22:33.480 --> 22:33.870
Yes.

22:34.480 --> 22:34.960
Sir,

22:35.760 --> 22:36.760
I'm just a merchant.

22:37.470 --> 22:38.230
I know little about

22:38.510 --> 22:39.920
autopsies and how to crack cases.

22:40.700 --> 22:42.050
But I've never seen anything

22:42.960 --> 22:43.830
spookier than this

22:44.520 --> 22:45.870
in my whole life.

22:46.910 --> 22:48.000
May I see the body?

22:49.800 --> 22:50.590
Please go ahead, sir.

22:52.690 --> 22:53.970
My son...

22:55.110 --> 22:56.430
My son!

22:57.320 --> 22:59.150
How could you leave me,

22:59.390 --> 23:01.040
your mother like this?

23:02.240 --> 23:04.110
My son...

23:06.500 --> 23:07.770
My son!

23:08.160 --> 23:10.030
Son, what happened to you?

23:10.180 --> 23:11.150
My son...

23:13.910 --> 23:14.760
Auntie! Auntie!

23:14.780 --> 23:15.280
Cuiying!

23:15.870 --> 23:16.350
Cuiying!

23:16.560 --> 23:16.870
Auntie...

23:16.890 --> 23:17.350
Hurry!

23:17.700 --> 23:18.530
Go get a doctor!

23:19.040 --> 23:19.430
Auntie...

23:19.450 --> 23:20.190
Cuiying!

23:20.960 --> 23:22.300
Come on, take her back to her room.

23:23.630 --> 23:24.280
Cuiying...

23:27.590 --> 23:28.080
Chief,

23:28.200 --> 23:29.450
Zhou Jingyuan's room is right in the rear.

23:31.040 --> 23:31.480
let's take a look.

23:52.770 --> 23:55.110
♫Torturous lovesickness♫

23:55.130 --> 23:58.600
♫Yet mutual confession is even harder♫

23:59.550 --> 24:05.510
♫Drifting like a willow in the wind, yearning for a good ending♫

24:05.230 --> 24:05.750
Jingyuan...

24:05.940 --> 24:11.610
♫Side by side, we share a gaze too deep for words♫

24:08.590 --> 24:09.830
It's my fault

24:11.750 --> 24:18.370
♫Keep silent with no regrets♫

24:18.520 --> 24:24.900
♫Share days and nights with you♫

24:25.190 --> 24:31.330
♫In exchange for a lifelong deep love♫

24:31.550 --> 24:34.840
♫Entwined through the endless night♫

24:35.060 --> 24:37.880
♫Blossoms fell into eternal sleep in a blink♫

24:37.900 --> 24:44.250
♫With no regrets, only joy in this life♫

24:45.200 --> 24:51.180
♫Share days and nights with you♫

24:47.080 --> 24:48.110
Because I promised you

24:49.040 --> 24:51.040
I will give you a proper and official wedding ceremony.

24:51.800 --> 24:57.770
♫In exchange for a lifelong deep love♫

24:52.240 --> 24:53.150
I also want everyone in the city

24:53.150 --> 24:54.080
to know that

24:55.320 --> 24:56.630
you will marry me,

24:58.000 --> 24:59.560
and that you're the most beautiful woman in the world.

24:58.200 --> 25:01.560
♫Entwined through the endless night♫

25:01.580 --> 25:04.460
♫Blossoms fell into eternal sleep in a blink♫

25:04.490 --> 25:12.350
♫With no regrets, only joy in this life♫

25:51.200 --> 25:52.440
What a coincidence.

25:55.400 --> 25:56.030
My Lady.

26:06.280 --> 26:06.830
My Lady?

26:10.500 --> 26:12.350
Why did you call me so loudly? Almost startled me.

26:13.190 --> 26:14.810
I've already been here for a while.

26:15.760 --> 26:17.110
What kept you so lost in thought,

26:17.430 --> 26:18.210
My Lady?

26:21.700 --> 26:22.670
Nothing.

26:23.610 --> 26:24.700
Do your work now.

26:32.670 --> 26:33.550
You're done?

26:37.850 --> 26:38.770
I've thought it through.

26:39.280 --> 26:40.590
Before we catch the Mirror Demon,

26:40.980 --> 26:42.330
you have to stay with me.

26:43.990 --> 26:44.400
Okay.

26:45.860 --> 26:46.270
Let's go.

26:56.260 --> 26:56.990
What are you doing?

27:09.640 --> 27:11.270
[Ganshan Clinic]

27:15.200 --> 27:16.160
Ms. Ji Li?

27:17.970 --> 27:18.620
Hello, Miss Duan.

27:18.980 --> 27:19.660
What a coincidence.

27:20.570 --> 27:21.850
What brings you here?

27:22.830 --> 27:23.840
Our dance troupe's invaded by rats.

27:24.030 --> 27:25.080
I came to buy a rat killer.

27:26.780 --> 27:27.910
You even sell that?

27:35.910 --> 27:36.390
Miss Duan,

27:37.080 --> 27:38.410
I have something to attend to. So I'll take my leave.

27:43.980 --> 27:44.560
Chi Xue.

27:46.520 --> 27:47.840
What did that woman just buy?

27:48.320 --> 27:48.870
Rat killer.

27:49.630 --> 27:50.110
Anything else?

27:51.580 --> 27:52.460
And a bottle of insect oil.

27:54.940 --> 27:55.610
What's insect oil?

27:58.320 --> 27:59.280
You have something to do with it?

28:00.260 --> 28:01.540
Another person died on North Street this morning.

28:02.530 --> 28:03.640
The victim was

28:03.670 --> 28:04.520
a young scholar.

28:04.760 --> 28:05.320
After his sudden death,

28:05.350 --> 28:06.430
he turned into a middle-aged man.

28:07.320 --> 28:08.240
That woman you saw just now

28:08.480 --> 28:09.390
was there mourning the deceased.

28:10.280 --> 28:11.390
I guess they knew each other.

28:12.190 --> 28:13.110
But I can't help feeling that

28:13.710 --> 28:14.710
this whole thing is kind of fishy.

28:18.040 --> 28:19.430
Insect oil is used to ward off evil things.

28:19.800 --> 28:20.790
When applied to a sharp weapon,

28:21.080 --> 28:22.480
it can cause damage to a demon's spiritual body.

28:23.320 --> 28:24.190
If it hits a vital spot,

28:24.800 --> 28:25.560
it can certainly be fatal.

28:26.830 --> 28:27.800
Now it all makes sense.

28:29.010 --> 28:29.530
That woman

28:29.560 --> 28:30.770
must know the whereabouts of the demon.

28:32.560 --> 28:33.390
Where is she?

28:35.000 --> 28:36.560
She once said

28:36.990 --> 28:39.000
they were from the Yunmen Dance Troupe.

28:39.690 --> 28:40.490
Yunmen Dance Troupe?

28:42.960 --> 28:44.280
The one who died at Yanlai Restaurant last time,

28:44.280 --> 28:45.280
the dancer named Tian Rui,

28:45.830 --> 28:46.890
was also one of the Yunmen Dance Troupe.

28:49.430 --> 28:50.210
Let's go find her.

28:54.240 --> 28:55.840
Didn't the previous victims

28:55.870 --> 28:57.470
all age abnormally when they died?

28:57.800 --> 28:58.560
Why did the victim

28:58.590 --> 28:59.630
turn middle-aged this time?

29:00.280 --> 29:01.680
Didn't Physician Jiu mention that

29:02.040 --> 29:03.210
it'd take seven full days

29:03.240 --> 29:03.930
for a jade pear

29:03.960 --> 29:05.350
to fully absorb the life force

29:05.830 --> 29:06.760
of the host eating the pear?

29:07.320 --> 29:08.800
I guess this time, that demon took out the pear

29:09.280 --> 29:10.570
before the time was up.

29:11.670 --> 29:12.520
Am I right, Physician Jiu?

29:13.390 --> 29:14.000
Maybe.

29:14.600 --> 29:15.910
Then why would he do this?

29:16.680 --> 29:17.780
Guess he messed up the timing.

29:18.800 --> 29:19.450
Messed up the timing

29:19.480 --> 29:20.830
of things like this? Really?

29:21.760 --> 29:22.620
Well, demons

29:22.830 --> 29:24.010
are all about murdering humans

29:24.040 --> 29:24.760
and are quite dumb.

29:25.150 --> 29:26.390
What's so surprising about that?

29:27.260 --> 29:28.070
Could that be the truth?

29:29.280 --> 29:30.870
Or maybe he just couldn't wait

29:31.150 --> 29:32.630
to kill that man on the spot.

30:19.540 --> 30:20.430
Chief Constable Chu.

30:21.760 --> 30:22.240
Banxia?

30:23.330 --> 30:24.050
What brings you here?

30:24.960 --> 30:26.350
We're here to find Ms. Ji Li.

30:27.190 --> 30:28.460
She's left.

30:31.430 --> 30:32.560
What? Where did she go?

30:33.520 --> 30:35.400
She bid farewell to the Manager yesterday,

30:35.620 --> 30:36.740
saying she'd be heading south.

30:37.130 --> 30:38.350
And she's already left the Dance Troupe.

30:50.080 --> 30:50.910
How long has it been

30:50.910 --> 30:52.040
since we last sat down

30:52.380 --> 30:54.140
and had a proper meal together like this?

30:55.090 --> 30:56.220
Whenever you visited,

30:56.480 --> 30:57.670
you made me eat those jade pears

30:58.630 --> 31:00.150
with a fishy smell

31:00.480 --> 31:01.430
and an awful taste.

31:02.110 --> 31:03.110
As time went by,

31:03.130 --> 31:04.140
I'd recall that fishiness

31:04.170 --> 31:05.520
at the sight of you every time.

31:06.210 --> 31:07.490
That's why I keep quarreling with you.

31:08.430 --> 31:09.630
Thinking about it now,

31:10.120 --> 31:11.310
I really shouldn't have acted this way.

31:13.050 --> 31:14.290
Today on the street,

31:14.370 --> 31:16.000
I ran into a woman in her sixties,

31:16.370 --> 31:17.630
gray-haired

31:17.830 --> 31:18.910
and wrinkled.

31:19.220 --> 31:19.910
Just one look

31:20.370 --> 31:21.390
and it was terrifying.

31:22.490 --> 31:24.180
A woman's youth

31:24.750 --> 31:25.550
is rather fleeting.

31:25.800 --> 31:26.930
Only about one or two decades.

31:28.670 --> 31:30.000
Just like a flower,

31:30.560 --> 31:31.840
before you can even appreciate it,

31:32.640 --> 31:33.440
it withers.

31:35.060 --> 31:36.070
What a pity.

31:40.740 --> 31:41.700
But luckily,

31:42.890 --> 31:43.760
I have you.

31:44.500 --> 31:45.630
You love me, spoil me,

31:46.180 --> 31:47.420
and make jade pears for me,

31:48.080 --> 31:49.910
helping me stay young for 20 years.

31:52.650 --> 31:53.350
This is something

31:53.370 --> 31:54.890
countless people dream of.

31:55.910 --> 31:56.910
Yet I was ungrateful,

31:57.760 --> 31:58.760
quarreling with you,

31:59.790 --> 32:01.070
saying things that hurt you,

32:01.810 --> 32:03.350
and doing things you hated.

32:04.580 --> 32:05.670
Thinking about it now,

32:07.660 --> 32:08.960
I was really rebellious.

32:12.080 --> 32:12.830
I never blame you.

32:17.440 --> 32:18.030
Really?

32:19.110 --> 32:19.670
Really.

32:31.800 --> 32:32.520
Chuan,

32:33.670 --> 32:34.240
thank you.

32:36.990 --> 32:37.560
Li,

32:40.990 --> 32:41.630
don't cry.

32:44.960 --> 32:45.790
Let bygones

32:47.420 --> 32:48.460
be bygones.

32:51.840 --> 32:52.660
As long as we can

32:52.680 --> 32:53.870
stay together forever,

32:55.860 --> 32:57.180
nothing else matters.

33:02.110 --> 33:03.070
I've made up my mind.

33:04.430 --> 33:05.520
When we leave this place

33:06.170 --> 33:07.000
and reach Jiangnan,

33:07.830 --> 33:09.000
let's find a nice place with mountains

33:09.390 --> 33:10.670
and water.

33:12.240 --> 33:13.930
I don't want to be in the public eye anymore.

33:15.430 --> 33:16.950
I just want to be with you,

33:17.670 --> 33:19.190
do the washing and cooking,

33:20.020 --> 33:21.350
play music and dance,

33:23.590 --> 33:25.000
and never see anyone else again.

33:25.320 --> 33:26.030
How does that sound?

33:27.350 --> 33:28.910
I've been looking forward to that kind of life

33:30.870 --> 33:31.830
for years.

33:34.590 --> 33:36.260
I've also been looking forward to that kind of life

33:38.150 --> 33:39.280
for a long time.

33:46.800 --> 33:48.430
Do you have to do this?

33:51.710 --> 33:52.910
How many times has this happened?

33:53.480 --> 33:54.760
Do you really want me dead?

33:58.180 --> 33:59.590
I've been so good to you,

34:01.280 --> 34:02.190
yet you betrayed me

34:03.240 --> 34:05.080
and had an affair with someone else.

34:05.100 --> 34:06.340
I don't even blame you!

34:09.110 --> 34:10.670
You've really disappointed me.

34:24.650 --> 34:26.250
Sirs and madam, are you here to book some rooms?

34:27.230 --> 34:27.960
We're here on official business.

34:28.480 --> 34:29.139
Yes, sir.

34:29.840 --> 34:30.639
Have you seen a girl

34:30.670 --> 34:31.230
around 17 or 18,

34:31.250 --> 34:32.199
slender in build,

34:32.230 --> 34:33.360
with deep-set eyes?

34:34.080 --> 34:35.590
She should have come alone.

34:36.750 --> 34:37.440
No.

34:38.719 --> 34:39.960
Please try to recall again.

34:40.230 --> 34:41.750
She's very fair-skinned, thin,

34:41.920 --> 34:43.050
and pretty.

34:43.520 --> 34:44.590
It really doesn't ring a bell.

34:46.080 --> 34:46.520
Sir,

34:47.150 --> 34:47.719
I think I've seen

34:47.750 --> 34:48.480
the person you described.

34:49.260 --> 34:49.699
Where is she?

34:50.350 --> 34:52.050
Upstairs, in the second room from the left.

34:52.080 --> 34:52.880
That girl looks

34:53.000 --> 34:54.159
like she stepped out of a painting.

34:54.190 --> 34:54.929
Her waist is very slim.

34:55.980 --> 34:57.420
I heard from some other guests that

34:57.440 --> 34:59.080
he's a dancer from Yunmen Dance Troupe.

35:04.380 --> 35:05.150
What kind of place is this?

35:06.750 --> 35:08.040
Are you playing tricks again?

35:09.090 --> 35:09.570
Yeah,

35:10.670 --> 35:11.590
I forgot that

35:12.440 --> 35:13.840
you don't remember anything.

35:15.550 --> 35:16.960
Let me help you recall it.

35:20.020 --> 35:20.570
Back then,

35:21.750 --> 35:24.750
you were sold to the mansion as a dancer.

35:26.340 --> 35:27.300
At first, you led

35:28.270 --> 35:29.270
a pretty good life.

35:30.880 --> 35:31.840
But as time went by,

35:32.010 --> 35:33.170
you grew older,

35:33.190 --> 35:34.070
losing your youthful charm

35:35.550 --> 35:36.480
and favor.

35:38.470 --> 35:39.700
Even the servants in the mansion

35:40.700 --> 35:42.300
could bully you at will

35:43.010 --> 35:44.010
and treat you like a toy.

35:51.690 --> 35:52.690
You were resentful.

35:53.590 --> 35:55.230
Day and night, you made wishes in front of the mirror,

35:56.880 --> 35:58.440
hoping to regain your youth.

36:00.300 --> 36:00.900
I

36:03.400 --> 36:04.480
heard your voice

36:06.780 --> 36:07.980
and came to you

36:14.330 --> 36:15.970
to fulfill your wish.

36:27.090 --> 36:28.630
Not only did you regain your beauty,

36:30.840 --> 36:32.070
but I also helped you take revenge

36:33.300 --> 36:34.940
by killing those who once hurt you.

36:37.510 --> 36:38.440
You're talking nonsense!

36:41.340 --> 36:42.300
I'm talking nonsense?

36:45.090 --> 36:45.980
Mirrors

36:48.940 --> 36:50.210
actually reflect

36:51.970 --> 36:53.170
human hearts.

36:56.630 --> 36:57.270
Greed

36:59.190 --> 37:00.520
comes at a price.

37:02.920 --> 37:04.000
Look at your face.

37:06.670 --> 37:07.630
So young,

37:09.080 --> 37:09.890
so radiant.

37:11.770 --> 37:12.950
How gorgeous.

37:15.630 --> 37:17.080
It's taken numerous human lives

37:18.690 --> 37:20.750
to maintain such a beautiful face.

37:22.650 --> 37:23.490
Over these years,

37:25.210 --> 37:26.490
how many people have you killed?

37:30.180 --> 37:31.210
That bookworm,

37:33.410 --> 37:34.190
if he knew that

37:34.210 --> 37:35.690
your beauty

37:36.360 --> 37:37.750
is backed by so much bloodshed,

37:39.700 --> 37:40.620
would he still love you?

37:42.560 --> 37:43.110
Would he?

37:43.940 --> 37:44.780
Would he really?

37:45.000 --> 37:45.870
I didn't do that!

37:46.980 --> 37:47.690
You didn't?

37:48.760 --> 37:49.510
What do you mean?

37:50.480 --> 37:51.560
Didn't kill with your own hands?

37:52.570 --> 37:53.730
Or didn't harm any lives?

37:55.680 --> 37:56.850
Don't tell me

37:57.560 --> 37:58.560
you have no idea how this pear

37:59.270 --> 38:00.590
is made.

38:04.050 --> 38:04.610
Li,

38:05.640 --> 38:06.290
come on...

38:07.440 --> 38:08.400
That's too hypocritical.

38:11.630 --> 38:12.440
I tried to kill myself.

38:15.090 --> 38:15.920
I once tried to kill myself.

38:16.450 --> 38:16.850
Right!

38:17.230 --> 38:17.920
I attempted that!

38:18.320 --> 38:19.030
You didn't allow it.

38:19.260 --> 38:20.440
You stopped me!

38:23.790 --> 38:25.140
If you really wanted to die,

38:26.570 --> 38:28.300
could I have kept an eye on you day and night?

38:32.000 --> 38:32.440
The path

38:33.250 --> 38:34.420
is yours to walk on your own.

38:36.160 --> 38:38.280
Is it so hard to admit that

38:38.620 --> 38:39.620
you're a cruel,

38:40.590 --> 38:41.510
cold-blooded creature?

38:48.310 --> 38:49.620
You're truly a devil.

38:53.250 --> 38:53.820
It was you.

38:54.420 --> 38:55.440
You deceived me.

38:55.580 --> 38:56.670
You beguiled me into eating the pears,

38:56.880 --> 38:58.000
saying they'd keep me young

38:58.020 --> 38:58.730
and alive forever!

38:59.110 --> 39:00.080
You deceived me,

39:00.100 --> 39:00.810
turning me into

39:00.840 --> 39:02.310
a monster like you!

39:03.490 --> 39:04.200
Li,

39:05.050 --> 39:05.740
people

39:07.170 --> 39:09.010
can't have everything they ask for.

39:11.380 --> 39:12.460
I just want to leave you.

39:13.580 --> 39:14.590
What did you say?

39:16.530 --> 39:17.400
I don't know why

39:17.400 --> 39:18.040
I met you.

39:19.000 --> 39:20.550
You must have bewitched me.

39:21.390 --> 39:22.360
I never want to eat those

39:22.360 --> 39:23.440
stinking, fishy pears again.

39:24.010 --> 39:25.560
I only want to stay with the person

39:25.560 --> 39:26.190
I love!

39:26.210 --> 39:26.900
Dream on!

39:28.510 --> 39:29.560
Having drained people's blood

39:29.740 --> 39:30.740
and reaped all the benefits,

39:31.730 --> 39:32.440
you still dream about

39:32.440 --> 39:33.560
living a normal life?

39:34.670 --> 39:35.480
I'd rather die

39:36.240 --> 39:37.850
than live with you.

39:38.670 --> 39:40.150
They called you a flirt,

39:40.840 --> 39:42.150
obsessed with seducing men,

39:42.880 --> 39:44.360
born with no shame.

39:44.820 --> 39:45.590
I don't believe it.

39:45.610 --> 39:46.590
I don't!

39:48.720 --> 39:49.560
I love you deeply.

39:50.750 --> 39:51.590
Have you forgotten that?

39:55.840 --> 39:57.040
You're a demon!

39:57.830 --> 39:58.750
You're not human.

39:59.630 --> 40:00.960
Do you know what love is?

40:01.160 --> 40:02.290
Do you understand it at all?

40:03.520 --> 40:04.440
Every moment

40:04.460 --> 40:05.380
with you,

40:05.400 --> 40:06.670
I hate myself.

40:08.270 --> 40:09.660
This isn't love at all.

40:09.690 --> 40:10.820
You don't deserve to talk about love!

40:11.020 --> 40:11.870
I don't deserve that?

40:13.060 --> 40:14.270
You're my one and only love

40:14.300 --> 40:15.530
in my whole life!

40:17.190 --> 40:18.030
What? I don't deserve it?

40:18.790 --> 40:20.000
Do you think you deserve it?

40:20.090 --> 40:20.900
No!

40:22.420 --> 40:24.250
I've destroyed myself with my own hands.

40:26.360 --> 40:27.440
I hate you.

40:28.460 --> 40:30.340
And I hate myself even more.

40:32.400 --> 40:33.360
They were right.

40:33.860 --> 40:35.380
I am a flirt

40:35.970 --> 40:37.190
obsessed with seducing men,

40:37.810 --> 40:38.670
born with no shame.

40:39.340 --> 40:40.670
I can be

40:40.690 --> 40:41.110
with anyone.

40:41.130 --> 40:42.050
Literally anyone!

40:43.040 --> 40:44.190
Except you.

40:45.090 --> 40:46.260
I'd rather age and die

40:46.670 --> 40:47.630
than be with you!

40:47.630 --> 40:48.630
Don't talk like that!

41:03.470 --> 41:04.790
I knew it.

41:12.400 --> 41:13.210
You think

41:13.980 --> 41:14.900
after all these years,

41:16.440 --> 41:17.440
this is really the first time

41:17.440 --> 41:18.310
you've fallen in love with someone?

41:22.000 --> 41:23.750
You think we've only been together

41:25.030 --> 41:26.220
for twenty years?

41:30.820 --> 41:31.980
What do you mean by that?

41:34.220 --> 41:34.820
It'll be okay.

41:36.620 --> 41:37.430
Don't be afraid.

41:38.560 --> 41:39.630
After today,

41:40.870 --> 41:42.360
we can be back to how we used to be.

41:42.970 --> 41:44.080
Don't touch me!
